# MedCNX

MedCNX is a secure, cloud-ready HR management platform designed for medical practices, clinics and healthcare organisations.

## Stack

- Next.js
- TypeScript
- NestJS
- PostgreSQL
- Prisma
- Google Cloud Run
- Google Cloud SQL
- Google Cloud Storage
- Google Secret Manager

## Applications

- `apps/web` — frontend web application
- `apps/api` — backend API

## Packages

- `packages/database` — Prisma schema and database client
- `packages/shared` — shared types, roles and permissions
- `packages/ui` — shared UI components

## Development

```bash
npm install
npm run dev